it is super small.

00:01:17.230 --> 00:01:21.350
But in general, we've published
these things several years ago.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:24.800
But in broadly, we've got
eliminating toil, automation,

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:27.880
release engineering,
simplicity, embracing risk, SLOs

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:29.110
