00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:24.400
So in general, though, the other
buckets that we've got here,

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:26.410
we've got eliminating
toil and automation.

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:30.400
I put that in the "stop doing
things manually" bucket.

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.960
Over in release
